  "result": "Perfect! All 190 tests pass. I've successfully added the overdue invoices report:\n\n**Features added:**\n\n1. **overdueInvoices(invoices, asOf)** - generate overdue report\n   - Returns array of overdue invoices sorted by most overdue first\n   - Filters by:\n     - Status: `'issued'` or `'partially_paid'` (excludes `'draft'` and `'paid'`)\n     - `dueDate < asOf` (strictly before - due date on or after asOf are not overdue)\n   - Each invoice mapped to: `{ number, customerId, dueDate, daysOverdue, due }`\n   - `daysOverdue`: calculated using `daysBetween(dueDate, asOf)`\n   - `due`: balance owed using `balanceDue()`\n   - Sorted: descending by `daysOverdue` (most overdue first)\n\n2. **Output Fields**\n   - `number`: Invoice number\n   - `customerId`: Customer ID\n   - `dueDate`: Original due date\n   - `daysOverdue`: Days past due date (integer)\n   - `due`: Amount still owed in cents\n\n**Test coverage (13 new overdue report tests):**\n- Empty report when no overdue invoices\n- Draft invoices excluded\n- Paid invoices excluded\n- Issued invoices included when overdue\n- Partially_paid invoices included when overdue\n- Invoices not overdue excluded (dueDate >= asOf)\n- Invoices overdue included (dueDate < asOf)\n- daysOverdue calculation accuracy\n- Sorting by daysOverdue (most overdue first)\n- All required fields included\n- Due amount calculation with partial payments\n- Multiple customers in report\n- Deeply overdue invoices (across years)\n\nReport provides clear view of which invoices need collection attention, sorted by urgency.",
